# Nemi Site

Nemi static site: Markdown + Go templates → plain HTML.

Structure: nemi.toml (TOML config) | content/ (markdown) | layouts/ (templates) | static/ (assets) | public/ (output, never edit)

Frontmatter fields: title, date, draft, tags, description
URL: content/blog/my-post.md → /blog/my-post/
Subdirectories → auto list pages

Commands: nemi new <name> | nemi build | nemi serve (localhost:3000) | nemi migrate hugo/jekyll <src>

Rules:
- public/ is deleted and regenerated on every build — never edit it
- static/ assets referenced as /filename.ext
- .Page.Content is template.HTML — output with {{.Page.Content}}
- nemi.toml is TOML not YAML

Full reference: AGENTS.md
